{"id": "t162-059", "text": "right so recap from the long call with giulia um her mum's coming over on the 2nd no the 3rd of november for two weeks and she wants to do a big welcome dinner on the sunday at 1 and invite everyone her brother aurelio is also coming but only for the weekend and he's bringing his new girlfriend who nobody's met yet and giulia's a bit stressed because her flat's still half painted so I said I'd help paint on the saturday morning from 10 and I should also bring a dessert to the dinner maybe that tiramisu", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "giulia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "coming over", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 2nd"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 3rd of november", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "two weeks", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "big welcome dinner", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the sunday at 1", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "aurelio", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "coming", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "girlfriend", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "giulia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit stressed", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d6", "type": "DATE", "text": "the saturday morning from 10"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "bring a dessert to the dinner", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "other", "timing": "on"}]}
